@startuml HU03_Visualizar_Marketplace
title HU-03 — Visualizar Marketplace\nDIP + Adapter + Decorator (caché TTL) (Sprint 1 · DeFi360)

skinparam sequenceArrowThickness 2
skinparam roundcorner 8
skinparam sequenceParticipantBorderColor #2E75B6
skinparam sequenceParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF3FB
skinparam noteBorderColor #F0A500
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1

actor       "Usuario"                       as User
boundary    "Frontend (React)\nPricesContext" as UI
control     "marketplaceController"         as MC
participant "<<interface>>\nIPriceOracle"   as IPO
participant "priceOracle (Singleton)\nCachedPriceOracle <<Decorator>>" as CPO
participant "SimulatedOracleAdapter\n<<Adapter>>" as SOA
database    "PostgreSQL\n(Offer, User)"     as DB

autonumber

note over MC, IPO
  marketplaceController.getOffers(priceOracle = priceOracle) depende
  de IPriceOracle (DIP). El singleton es CachedPriceOracle envolviendo
  a SimulatedOracleAdapter (Decorator + Adapter).
end note

User -> UI : Abre /marketplace { type, minApy, maxAmount... }
UI -> MC : GET /api/marketplace/offers?type&minApy...

MC -> DB : Offer.findAll(where: filtros, include: User)
DB --> MC : List<Offer>

loop por cada offer con collateralType y collateralAmount
    MC -> IPO : getPrice(collateralType)
    IPO -> CPO : getPrice(symbol)
    activate CPO
    alt caché válida (no expiró TTL)
        CPO --> MC : precio (HIT, stats.hits++)
    else MISS o TTL vencido
        CPO -> SOA : getPrice(symbol)
        SOA --> CPO : precio (prices[symbol], volatility=0)
        CPO -> CPO : cache.set(symbol, { price, expiresAt })
        CPO --> MC : precio (MISS, stats.misses++)
    end
    deactivate CPO
    MC -> MC : offerData.collateralValueUSD / ltv
end

MC --> UI : 200 { success, count, offers enriquecidas }
UI --> User : Render de ofertas con precio y LTV

note over User, DB
  GET /api/marketplace/prices reutiliza el mismo singleton:
  priceOracle.getPrices(adapter.getSupportedSymbols()).
  Frontend consume precios via PricesContext (sin oráculo hardcodeado).
end note

@enduml
